# CVE-2026-78661 (GO-2026-6860) is an O(n^2) denial of service in
# golang.org/x/net/html, fixed in v0.62.0. Docker 29.9.3 still bundles
# containerd/runc built with v0.58.0/v0.55.0, and buildx 0.38.2 still embeds
# v0.59.0. None of these binaries parse HTML. Remove when the Docker static
# package and buildx ship v0.62.0.
CVE-2026-78661 exp:2027-01-31

